00:20:36.000 --> 00:21:17.000
problem or physical problem. So what about hoarding across the lifespan? I mean, at what age do people tend to show hoarding tendencies? I know you've talked about that genetic component, but, when do we see that part activated and does it get worse as you get older? It does. You are three times as likely to have hoarding disorder between ages 55 to 94. Very specific, right? I have certainly seen hoarding as early as 11, but it's harder when you're a young person like that to know what you're seeing. is this a kid who is just really fond of these things?

